<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Compaq EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Compaq EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised its fourth quarter earnings per share estimate for Compaq Computer Corp to $1.68 from $1.60 and its full-year 1996 EPS view to $4.75 from $4.67.</p>
<p>-- Merrill said it raised its full-year 1997 EPS forecast to $6.40 from $6.00.</p>
<p>-- Compaq shares were up 1-1/8 at 84-7/8.</p>
</text>
